    "module": {
      "purpose": "Defines the line shape schema, runtime property validation, and versioned migrations for persisted line-shape records.",
      "summary": "This schema module describes the configurable properties and point data used by canvas line and spline records. It exposes a spline style option, validates point dictionaries and shape properties at runtime, and provides a chronological migration sequence that upgrades or downgrades older handle-based representations into indexed point-based representations. The migrations preserve point ordering, reconstruct legacy handle metadata when downgrading, and add or remove the scale property across schema versions.",
      "businessContext": "Line and spline records are persisted canvas entities whose geometry and styling must remain compatible across document versions. Failure would make existing drawings invalid, reorder line points, or prevent older documents from loading correctly.",
